        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "represents much more than a traditional “mission,” and it goes much deeper than company policy. The beliefs and values represented in that "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          285.26934685479137,
          673.5896010802469,
          10.885174603174619
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "document are the very foundation of our corporate culture, and guide the attitude and actions of every member, every day."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          170.83333333333334,
          304.55212169312176,
          743.2642924382716,
          10.885174603174619
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "From its beginnings, HON INDUSTRIES has sought to implement its vision through sound policies and practices, and by maintaining "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          323.83489653145216,
          800.0949112654321,
          10.885174603174619
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "a strong Board composed predominantly of outside directors. We are fully committed to executing our responsibilities, and we will continue to "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          343.11767136978256,
          675.0951172839506,
          10.885174603174619
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "maintain the company’s long-standing tradition of an independent, well-informed, active, and engaged Board of Directors."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          170.83333333333334,
          362.40044620811284,
          743.1253638117284,
          10.885174603174733
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Our board meetings and procedures have been developed and refined to encourage open and informed communication. The company’s "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          381.68322104644324,
          799.9173711419752,
          10.885174603174733
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "accounting policies have always been conservative and straightforward. The Board’s three committees — Audit; Human Resources and "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          400.96599588477363,
          708.9835470679013,
          10.885138447971826
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Compensation; Public Policy and Corporate Governance — have consisted entirely of non-management directors for many years."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          170.83333333333334,
          420.2488068783068,
          743.289885802469,
          10.885102292769034
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "During 2003, we have given significant attention to the newly released rules emanating from the Sarbanes-Oxley Act of 2002 and the "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          439.5315817166372,
          705.7819247685184,
          10.885102292769034
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "New York Stock Exchange listing requirements — rules intended to improve corporate governance across the country. It is gratifying"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          830.7694124228394,
          439.5315817166372,
          83.24017091049393,
          10.885102292769034
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "to report that "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          458.8143565549676,
          503.70519945987655,
          10.885102292769034
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "HON INDUSTRIES governance practices were already in accord with the spirit of the rules."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          170.83333333333334,
          478.097131393298,
          740.2774930555555,
          10.885102292769034
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "It is an honor to serve as directors of HON INDUSTRIES. We are very proud to represent you, the shareholder, as we oversee the man-"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          497.3799062316284,
          699.0877098765432,
          10.885102292769034
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "agement of this great company. Please be assured that we intend to remain vigilant and focused on good corporate governance."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          535.9454559082892,
          54.13515354938272,
          10.885102292769034
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Sincerely,"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          555.2282307466196,
          238.445544367284,
          10.885102292769034
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "The HON INDUSTRIES Board of Directors"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
